ries these two projects  might be totally separate but I also  really wouldn't be surprised to learn  that they're one in the same seeing as  okoya is now a Midnight Angel and  midnight Angels deal directly with  regular Ugandan citizens whether or not  there are two upcoming wakanda-based  Disney Plus shows in the works there's a  good chance that we're gonna see some  storyline inspired by a nation under our  feet in the coming years if a show  featuring The Midnight Angels does  hypothetically exist we may not see it  for a very long time recently in an  interview with collider MCU producer  Nate Moore revealed that coogler's  wakanda TV series is slightly behind  schedule because coogler has been  putting maximum effort into wakanda  forever and next year's ironheart Series  so with this in mind I believe that we  might see the midnight Angels make a  brief appearance in 2024's Thunderbolts  but we likely won't get to explore the  true evolution of this Duo until 2025 at  the earliest with all the speculation  that Dr Doom will be making his big  moves for 2026 as a vendor's Secret Wars  I think that this lines up nicely with  including Doom as part of an attempt at  destabilizing wakanda so what's next for  the midnight angels I think that we can  expect them to be wakanda's first line  of defense at some point in 2025 or 2026  follow me on Instagram and Twitter  whitneypuppy follow me Rockstar  subscribe to new rockstars for more  analysis of everything you love and  thanks for watching bye  [Music]  thank you  [Music]

